OL,3,GNEWSAMan injured in street attack dies
OL,4,Ain hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after he was found
OL,7,Fcritically injured in the street in
OL,8,FLeeds.
OL,10,FThe 42-year-old man, who has not been
OL,11,Fnamed, was found just after 15:30 BST
OL,12,Fon Wednesday in Lister Hill, in
OL,13,FHorsforth, following what West
OL,14,FYorkshire Police have described as a
OL,15,F"disturbance"
OL,17,FHe was taken to hospital for treatment,
OL,18,Fbut died as a result of his injuries on
OL,19,FThursday evening, the force said.
