OL,3,GNEWSAMan injured in street attack dies
OL,4,Ain hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FFive people, aged between 44 and 74,
OL,7,Fwere arrested on suspicion of assault
OL,8,Fand have been bailed pending further
OL,9,Finquiries.
